00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.800
I knew it was a bad idea to change schools.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:09.340
Due to the nature of my parents job, I've had to transfer many times before.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.710
I had a hard time because I couldn't adjust to the new environment.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.080
It's cold.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.480
Yuuichi!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:23.280
I have club activities, so can you go home alone?

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:26.590
I just have to go back the way we came this morning, right?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.310
That's a piece of cake.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.180
You won't get lost?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.500
I won't, I won't.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.890
But, maybe it's not so bad since Nayuki is here.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.080
Compared to a place where I didn't know anyone.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:39.990
Oh yeah, Nayuki...

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.380
What?

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:45.690
Don't ever tell anyone that I'm freeloading in your house.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.030
Why?

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:48.190
Why!?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.350
Because we're living under one roof.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:55.630
It's not a good story any way you look at it.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:58.840
Sorry, too late.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.220
Wh-What do you mean... "too late"?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.050
