00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.190
What!?

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:05.800
I'm sorry!

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:08.920
What the hell was she thinking?

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.750
Maybe she's not thinking anything.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:15.620
Before you came to this classroom, she was happily talking about it.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.500
That look from a while ago was for that?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.150
Should I skip school tomorrow?

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.800
Being a truant so suddenly isn't good.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.250
I'll go back to my hometown!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.760
Give it up.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.450
That Nayuki...

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.780
How can she be so happy blabbering about that...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:41.470
Now any hope for new encounters is gone.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:50.090
Ayu!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.180
Move, move, move!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.620
Ughuu, it really hurts.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.960
Hey you, is it a hobby of yours to run into other people?
Ughuu, it really hurts.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.160
Hey you, is it a hobby of yours to run into other people?

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.530
Ughuu... It's not like that.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.540
Huh, isn't that yesterday's...?

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:21.720
Run!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.640
Again? It's happening again!?

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.920
I'll explain later! Just run!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:33.760
This is far enough...

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.150
Geez... why me?

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.550
Because you ate taiyaki yesterday!

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.130
I'm an accomplice without my knowledge?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:46.500
I'm hungry from all the running.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:49.530
Checking up on your stolen goods already?

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.710
You make it sound so bad.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.360
It's the truth.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.890
I forgot my wallet again.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:59.260
Check if you have your wallet before you buy it.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.930
Ughuu... It's fine since I'm gonna pay for it all someday.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.470
Didn't you say something like that yesterday?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.660
Here, let's eat while it's still warm.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.310
If I eat this, you're gonna treat me like an accomplice.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:14.360
It's alright. One or two won't make a difference.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.800
I can't go back, can I?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:22.810
It's yummy.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:23.810
Yeah, it is...

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.850
Ayu...

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.920
What is it?

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.650
That thing you have on your head.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.050
"Why do I have this thing?"

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:37.190
This?

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.230
This is...

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.600
...something I got from someone special...

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.890
Someone special...?

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:48.230
Yeah... someone special...

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:52.030
It's snowing...

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.720
So, should we go home?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.990
Okay!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.160
Don't tell me you don't know the way back?

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.560
Yeah, it's the first time I've been here.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:10.360
Ah, you also don't know it either?

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.790
If a local person doesn't know,

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:16.660
There's no way that a person who moved here two days ago knows.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.240
Eh? Really?

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.070
Yeah, but I briefly lived here a long time ago.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.900
Was that about seven years ago?

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:28.630
Yeah, the last time I came here was about that time.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.560
Hey, how did you know?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.110
Could you be Yuuichi-kun?

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.540
Really the real Yuuichi-kun?

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.180
What are you talking about? I am me.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.680
I see...

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:42.380
What's wrong?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:46.540
To tell the truth, I was thinking about it when we met yesterday.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:52.490
The name was the same, and you were the same "you" that I knew a long time ago...

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:53.920
Ayu...?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.140
You came back...

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.400
You kept the promise with me.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.220
It... wasn't... a dream...?

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.410
It's been a long time... Yuuichi-kun...

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.460
Yeah... it's really been a long time.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:24.680
Welcome back, Yuuichi-kun!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.370
Are you all right, Ayu!?

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.160
Ughuu...

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.160
You dodged! Yuuichi-kun dodged!

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Sorry, but I've just been run into twice. It's a reflex.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:47.730
Ughuu... Then you should have dodged at the shopping center!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.200
Hey!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:54.830
Are you okay?

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:59.700
Oh man, it's all your fault Ayu!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.890
It's because Yuuichi-kun dodged!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:05.040
Um... That's because you moved so suddenly.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.910
How mean! It was a touching reunion scene!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.270
Can you stand up?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.960
Yes...

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:17.900
Are you alright?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.860
It's alright. I'll pick them up by myself.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.590
You can't be a mature adult if you want to touch other people's stuff.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.270
That's not it!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:37.030
I was just trying to help pick the stuff up.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:41.660
Um... I'm sorry, I didn't mean to say something like that...

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:44.200
Oh, don't worry. She's the one who's at fault.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.560
I'm a good girl.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.030
Good girls don't avoid paying the bill.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.280
Avoiding bills...

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.540
That was by chance!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.480
It's been two days in a row! At the same shop, too!

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:56.170
That shop's taiyaki is the best!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:56.670
You're a pro since you do it that much.
That shop's taiyaki is the best!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.350
You're a pro since you do it that much.

