That uniform...

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.430
It's the same uniform that my sister wears to school.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.860
What grade are you in?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.730
I'm a first year student.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.130
That means you're a year younger than me.

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.670
That means you're a year younger than me.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:19.180
Eh? Ayu is in the same grade as me?

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.500
Yeah, I am.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.550
Really, I was pretty sure that...

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.860
Pretty sure of what?

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.440
I have to go home now.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.980
Sorry for causing you trouble.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:29.270
Sorry.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.490
Well, now...

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.170
Umm...

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.180
Huh?

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:37.940
Um, nothing.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.130
Ah, wait a sec!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.350
I want to ask something.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:44.140
Yes.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.000
Which way is the shopping center?

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.000
What...?

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:05.850
Is it delicious?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.750
Today's is much more delicious.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:12.590
Of course it is. Nothing's delicious when you cry.

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.650
So don't cry. Ayu is...

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:25.410
cuter smiling instead of crying...

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:34.760
Yuuichi-kun... can I ask something?

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.190
What?

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:39.060
Do you like your mother?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:41.850
Yeah, I like her...

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.580
Me too, I like her a lot...

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.440
Why are you asking me that?

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.960
My mom... she went somewhere...

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:03.390
She left me and went somewhere...

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.840
Ayu...

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.390
That's all.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.530
I have to go home now.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.250
Okay.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.450
Let's play again tomorrow, too.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:34.870
Really?

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.060
If it's fine with Ayu.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.740
Yeah! When I'm with Yuuichi-kun, it's fun.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.210
And I can remember the fun times.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.310
Then let's pinky swear!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.740
Pinky swear...?

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.680
Speaking of which, I think I did it...

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:13.680
Yuuichi!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.610
Yuuichi!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.440
What is it?

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:20.530
Sheesh, I was calling you for the whole time...

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:23.500
You still don't have your textbook right?

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:25.070
Oh yeah...

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.450
