00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.650
Just as I thought, you guys have a good relationship.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.870
I prefer you keep your textbook.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.720
but you will have a hard time if you don't have it.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.330
Should I lend you mine?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:42.630
I'm Kitagawa. We help each other when someone's in trouble. Here!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.980
Thank you... but, is it alright?

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:49.330
It's okay... I'll just share with Misaka.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.470
Eh! Why do I have to?

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:55.910
Don't be picky. We help each other when someone's in trouble.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.700
You're not the one who's in trouble!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.040
What a weird guy.
You're not the one who's in trouble!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:58.770
What a weird guy.

