00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.030
Aizawa, what are you doing?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.180
Sorry! Toilet!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:35.580
Yuuichi...

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.020
What's up with him?

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.370
Hey!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.470
Don't scare me.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.390
What in the world are you doing?

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:07.650
People who don't have business here are trespassing.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.020
It's alright.

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:13.940
That's because I'm also a student in this school.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.210
Is that so?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.150
Today, I'm absent from school.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.450
Don't you call that "being truant"?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.170
It's not truant.

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:27.090
I have a poor health condition.

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.810
So I'm absent for most of the time from school.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:32.490
Are you sick?

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.170
It's... just a cold.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.500
Cold? Just a regular cold?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.180
Yes!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.510
Then you shouldn't really be here.

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:47.310
I came secretly to see someone today.

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:48.550
Who?

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.520
That's.. a secret.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.780
It worries me when you say "a secret".

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:57.330
It's fine.

00:18:58.190 --> 00:19:02.020
The secret of a girl who's sick and has been resting for a long time...

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:06.000
Isn't it cool, like a drama?

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:07.930
Don't say it to yourself.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.810
Then, I'll go home for today.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:16.980
Aren't you supposed to meet someone?

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:20.450
That's okay. My business here is done.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.870
Hey, wait! What's your name?

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.780
It's Shiori. Misaka Shiori.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:34.980
Misaka... Shiori...

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:36.550
"Misaka"...?

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.660
Please call me "Shiori"!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.810
I'm Aizawa...

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.320
..."Yuuichi-san", right?

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.000
How...?

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:52.120
The girl wearing the douffle coat was calling you like that.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.920
You have a good memory.

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.890
My memory is the only thing good.

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:57.890
I envy that.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.060
Well, thank you very much.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.310
"Misaka Shiori"...?

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:12.210
See you!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:13.510
Hey, let's go home quickly.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.150
Aizawa-kun, see you.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:15.830
Yeah.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.600
What a long time in the toilet.

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.070
Did you flush it?

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.280
Yeah.

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.360
The teacher was mad.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:23.510
Yeah, I thought so.

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:27.670
You should go to the staff room and apologize to him.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.420
Fine.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:31.610
By the way, Kaori...

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.610
What is it, Aizawa-kun?

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:36.120
Your last name is "Misaka", right?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:37.840
That's right.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.920
Do you have any sisters?

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.040
No, I don't.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.510
Hold on!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.600
If you don't have any sisters, how about relatives who are about your age?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.500
I said I don't have any sisters!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.830
Why did you think of a joke like that!?

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.620
Kaori...?

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:03.350
Um, it was an uncommon last name, so I just asked.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.290
I have club activities now, so...

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.220
See you...

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.980
O-Okay.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.560
That Kaori...

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:24.040
She said it was a joke, but seeing her that angry, it didn't seem like a joke at all.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.660
What is it?

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:35.250
So it means, that Shiori wanted to meet Kaori?

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:39.660
But real sisters meeting at school is weird...

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:42.850
I don't get it!

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:49.260
I finally found you!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:52.380
What!?

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:54.980
I won't forgive you!

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:56.880
Who the heck are you?

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.460
I don't remember anyone bearing a grudge against me!

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:02.290
Even if you don't, I do!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:11.750
I've had this grudge for a long time. Now I'll settle the score!

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:13.370
Get ready!

